re-issued as all-closed / closed-with-non-claims / rejected-with-reason. Every one
of its seven items now carries a verdict and the commit that supports it, and the
three gaps the audit did NOT name — the ungoverned third-party transfer, the
missing spend ceiling, and an undeclared `real-ml` — are added with theirs.

Two of the seven verdicts correct this audit rather than confirm it:
