    was wrong for `structured_data_extract` — no codegen lowering exists, and the
    registered struct layout is only part of what a binding needs;
  * item 7 was one defect short: closing the clean-checkout build revealed a
    second, introduced by a commit made while executing this plan.

Also committed: the four audit inputs this document cites (CHECKLIST,
EXTRACTION-ENGINE-SPEC, REA-INTEGRATION-ASSESSMENT, RECONCILIATION-2026-10-12),
which were untracked. No file's content changed except the audit's Part E and its
non-claims section.
